WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:19.983
Kip opened the bottle.

2
00:00:19.984 --> 00:00:22.689
"It's a note!" said Kip.

3
00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:27.615
"I wonder who wrote it."

4
00:00:27.616 --> 00:00:29.447
Kip read the note.

5
00:00:29.448 --> 00:00:33.264
It said: Hello. How are you?

6
00:00:33.265 --> 00:00:39.802
Please write back to me.

7
00:00:39.803 --> 00:00:42.822
"Cool!" said Kip.

8
00:00:42.823 --> 00:00:50.043
"I will write back."

9
00:00:50.044 --> 00:00:52.998
Kip got a pencil and paper.

10
00:00:52.999 --> 00:00:58.154
He wrote a note.

11
00:00:58.155 --> 00:01:03.470
He put the note in the bottle.

12
00:01:03.471 --> 00:01:11.094
Later Bird went to the pond.

13
00:01:11.095 --> 00:01:19.758
She found the bottle.

14
00:01:19.759 --> 00:01:23.491
"Someone wrote back to me!" cried Bird.

15
00:01:23.492 --> 00:01:26.053
The new note said: Hello.

16
00:01:26.054 --> 00:01:27.728
I am fine.

17
00:01:27.729 --> 00:01:29.919
I am writing back to you.

18
00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:35.951
"This is so much fun!" said Bird.

19
00:01:35.952 --> 00:01:46.528
Bird wrote a new note.

20
00:01:46.529 --> 00:01:49.417
Kip read Bird's new note the next day.

21
00:01:49.418 --> 00:01:52.525
The note said: I live in the park.

22
00:01:52.526 --> 00:01:55.004
Do you live in the park too?

23
00:01:55.005 --> 00:01:58.560
"Wow!" thought Kip.

24
00:01:58.561 --> 00:02:01.970
"I do live in the park!"
